Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "xofomop458@pmdeal.com",
  "password": "Test@1234"
}

### 3. Click the link in your email, or call directly:
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/verify-email?email=test@example.com&token=YOUR_TOKEN


